{
  "what": "every file under this results root that .gitignore keeps out of git, by hash",
  "why_not_committed": [
    "stream.jsonl / source_stream.jsonl / transcript.jsonl are the raw Claude Code captures; the transcripts carry account context Claude Code injects into every session (including the operator's email address), and all of them embed absolute local paths",
    "velra_home/ holds each Velra arm's SQLite ledger, debug log and settings backup: the full event log of the source session on the operator's machine",
    "memory_quarantine-*/ holds Claude Code auto-memory left by the earlier, invalidated run, moved aside (never deleted) before the trial so the memory directory was empty"
  ],
  "how_to_use": "anyone given the raw files can verify them against this list; `python bench/tokenburn/aggregate.py --trials <root>/trials --out <root>` over them reproduces analysis.json, causal_chain.json, aggregate.json, verdicts.json and report.md",
